data: {"id": "553511bfdd9f4998-thinking-parallel_evidence-1063", "run_id": "553511bfdd9f4998", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将基于已有的初步证据，进一步采集 Metrics、Logging、Tracing 和 Topology 数据来全面诊断该 Pod 的 NotReady 问题。\n\n**执行计划：**\n1. **Pod 拓扑关系确认** - 获取 Pod 的 owner、service、node 绑定关系\n2. **Prometheus Metrics 查询** - 检查 Pod 的资源使用情况和异常指标\n3. **Elasticsearch 日志查询** - 搜索应用层错误日志和异常模式\n4. **DeepFlow Tracing 查询** - 检查服务间的调用链路和异常\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788464510767, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

